Tracked runs land here: one markdown checklist per departure, plus audit.log.

Commit them. They are the record of what was revoked and rotated, and when —
the thing you show a client who asks whether their credentials were handled
when a person left, and the thing that tells you next time which steps got
skipped and why.

Never paste a credential into a run file. `killswitch.py check` and
`killswitch.py complete` both refuse if one appears.
